# VK Music access token. The bot uses VK as its only audio source.
# IMPORTANT: tokens from vkhost.github.io (implicit OAuth flow) do NOT
# work with audio.search any more — VK silently revoked it. Use the
# direct-auth flow instead: run `python scripts/get_vk_audio_token.py`
# locally, sign in with login + password (+ 2FA), paste the resulting
# token here.
